OL,3,AMacau jails pro-democracy campaigner in
OL,4,Acity's first national security case
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacau has sentenced an ex-lawmaker and
OL,7,Fpro-democracy campaigner to 12 years
OL,8,Fand six months' jail in the city's
OL,9,Ffirst national security case.
OL,11,FFollowing a closed-door trial, Au Kam
OL,12,FSan, 69, was convicted on Friday of
OL,13,F"subversion against the political power
OL,14,Fof the state", among other offences.
OL,16,FHis wife Virginia Cheang condemned the
OL,17,Fruling, calling the case a "groundless
OL,18,Fpersecution designed to humiliate Au".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
