OL,3,AMacau jails pro-democracy campaigner in
OL,4,Acity's first national security case
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacau was handed back to China in 1999,
OL,7,Fending over 400 years of Portuguese
OL,8,Fadministration. Its national security
OL,9,Flaw came into effect in 2009,
OL,10,Fcriminalising acts of treason,
OL,11,Fsecession, and subversion against the
OL,12,FChinese Communist Party.
